# Everything the release job runs with the signing key and the Central token at hand, and
# everything that decides whether it may run. A tag runs release.yml as its commit has it, and
# `./mvnw -Prelease ... deploy` then runs the wrapper, every POM of the reactor and the plugins
# they name, so a change to any of these paths must be reviewed by the release managers.
# Everything else is reviewed as usual: nothing here makes anyone the owner of the code.
# Branch protection on main requires a code owners' review (RELEASING.md).

# the workflows, this file and the PR template; the actions the release uses are named there
/.github/                       @oddin-gg/ragnar-admin

# the process, and the notes that become the public release text
/RELEASING.md                   @oddin-gg/ragnar-admin
/release-notes/                 @oddin-gg/ragnar-admin

# the scripts the release job runs: the checks, the tag check, the GitHub Release
/scripts/release-*              @oddin-gg/ragnar-admin
# the legacy SDK installer and its test, which the release's build job runs on the commit it
# publishes (the publish job does not), the checksums the installer reads, and the pinned form of
# next.yml, which that build is held to
/scripts/fetch-sdk*             @oddin-gg/ragnar-admin
/system-tests/src/test/resources/sdk-jar-checksums.properties @oddin-gg/ragnar-admin
/scripts/next-workflow.json     @oddin-gg/ragnar-admin

# the Maven wrapper runs before any POM is read, and downloads the Maven that runs the build
/mvnw                           @oddin-gg/ragnar-admin
/mvnw.cmd                       @oddin-gg/ragnar-admin
/.mvn/                          @oddin-gg/ragnar-admin

# every POM of the reactor, not only the root: any of them can add or change a plugin that runs
# in the release build; the release profile itself is in the root one
**/pom.xml                      @oddin-gg/ragnar-admin

# the schema drift job (schema_shape.py is part of it)
/scripts/schema-drift*          @oddin-gg/ragnar-admin
/scripts/schema_shape.py        @oddin-gg/ragnar-admin
